{"title": "Luke", "pageid": 2070, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Lukes</b> real name is actually Rinaldo and he is the son of <a href=\"/wiki/Brand\" title=\"Brand\">Brand</a> and the sorceress <a href=\"/wiki/Jasra\" title=\"Jasra\">Jasra</a>. Luke was friends with <a href=\"/wiki/Merlin\" title=\"Merlin\">Merlin</a> for many years on the shadow <a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Earth</a> although Merlin had no idea of his true identity. At first, Lukes main focus was revenge for the death of his father, and attempted to kill Merlin every April 30th (the date he learned of his fathers death). However, he eventually became good friends with Merlin. Luke has traversed the pattern in <a href=\"/wiki/Tir-na_Nog%27th\" title=\"Tir-na Nog&#39;th\">Tir-na Nog'th</a> and can traverse <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">shadow</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Luke?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501231348\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 315/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.545      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.545      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2070-0!sseVary=RegularPag